    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n90550" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προ-τρεπτικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hortatory</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					1.3
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Po.</u>
				5
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.2291a
			</span></i>.<i><span class="en">
				4
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ π. σοφία</span> skill
				<i>in oratory</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Euthd.</u>
				278c
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Chrysipp.Stoic.
				3.189
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π.</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγος</span>), ὁ,
			title of works by Aristotle, Epicurus, Cleanthes, etc.: 
				Comp.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδὲν -κώτερον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arr.
					<u>Epict.</u>
					3.23.36
				</span></i>
			: 
				Sup.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κήρυγμα -κώτατον πρὸς ἀρετήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					3.154
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>
			<i>encouragingly</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Somn.</u>
				3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> generally,
				<i>exciting, stimulating</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς οὔρησιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Acut.</u>
					59
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γάλακτος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Gp.</u>
					12.13.2
				</span></i>
			.</div>
